// EXPECT-ERROR: value 99 does not fit in tone, which is u8 <= 63
// EXPECT-AT: 9:18
// The same reach, one check along: a unit's bound holds a ternary's constant
// arm. One arm carries the unit, so the merge does - which is exactly the
// shape that slipped past §75 during §41's build.
unit tone = u8 <= 63
u16 c = 0
tone t = 0
t = c == 0 ? t : 99
